<title>USA: Morgan Products names Mitchell Lahr CFO.</title>
<headline>Morgan Products names Mitchell Lahr CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WILLIAMSBURG, Va. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Products Ltd said Mitchell Lahr has been named vice president, finance and administration, chief financial officer and secretary.</p>
<p>Lahr replaces Douglas MacMillan, formerly vice president, chief financial officer and secretary. MacMillan has left the company to pursue other opportunities, Morgan Products said.</p>
</text>
